message: "If you use or refer to this work, please cite it as below."
title: "CARS: Reactive SDN for Securing ICS Environments — A Criticality- and Operation-Aware Response Framework"
abstract: >-
  An SDN intrusion-response system for industrial control systems whose response
  is conditioned on asset criticality and the industrial operation recovered from
  the traffic, so that automated response can be enabled without risking the
  physical process. Built and validated on a hardware testbed with real Siemens
  S7-1212C PLCs and a live tank process.
type: software
